  "title": "LSM6DSV320X High Accuracy Mode",
  "content": "<p>Hi,</p><p>I am using LSM6DSV320X for my project. Initially to save power I have Low G accelerometer with 15Hz ODR and 16G with fifo enabled. Once an activity is detected i want to switch on High G as well with 4000 Hz (with High Accuracy mode) and use both high G and Low G accelerometer for data collection. Is this possible if I dont use FSM or ASC and will High Accuracy then work ?. or can this only be achieved with FSM ?</p><p> </p><p>I look forward to your reply.</p>",
